WEBVTT

00:00:07.986 --> 00:00:09.335
What happened?

00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:10.598
Where's Po?

00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:14.166
He took Kai away.
He saved us.

00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:15.867
LI: No.

00:00:17.474 --> 00:00:19.954
He saved us,
but who's saving him?

00:00:24.568 --> 00:00:26.396
Whoa!

00:00:26.439 --> 00:00:28.702
The Spirit Realm.
It worked!

00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:31.080
[WHIMPERS]
Get off me, you...

00:00:31.662 --> 00:00:34.665
You brought me back? [GRUNTS]

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:36.014
Don't blame me.
I tried to finish this

00:00:36.057 --> 00:00:37.189
in the regular realm.

00:00:37.232 --> 00:00:39.017
Then we'll finish it here!

00:00:42.455 --> 00:00:43.798
[GASPS]

00:00:46.832 --> 00:00:47.982
Whoa!

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:49.829
[GRUNTS]

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.798
[GASPS]

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.305
[GRUNTING]

00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:11.179
[ALL MURMURING]

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.793
Come on, son. Fight!

00:01:23.104 --> 00:01:24.323
We have to help him.

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:26.717
We have to help him!

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.446
Okay.
Everyone gather around.

00:01:28.459 --> 00:01:30.111
That's it. Come in close.
Come on.

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:31.678
We can do this.

00:01:39.556 --> 00:01:41.383
LI: Po...

00:01:41.427 --> 00:01:44.592
You taught us who we were
meant to be.

00:01:47.825 --> 00:01:49.870
A father.

00:01:53.874 --> 00:01:54.962
A friend.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.269
A dumpling kicker.

00:01:57.312 --> 00:01:59.290
A lethal fighting machine.

00:01:59.413 --> 00:02:01.104
A hugger.

00:02:02.143 --> 00:02:03.754
A nunchuck chick.

00:02:04.276 --> 00:02:06.017
Stripy Baby.

00:02:07.279 --> 00:02:08.628
A family.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:40.099
Sweet!

00:02:40.399 --> 00:02:41.709
[KAI GROANS]

00:02:44.011 --> 00:02:45.230
[SNORTING]

00:02:47.145 --> 00:02:48.146
[GROWLING]

00:02:48.189 --> 00:02:49.887
Whoa.

00:02:55.414 --> 00:02:57.372
Who are you?

00:02:57.416 --> 00:02:59.113
I've been asking
the same question.

00:03:04.118 --> 00:03:05.857
Am I the son of a panda?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.600
The son of a goose?

00:03:07.644 --> 00:03:09.310
A student?

00:03:09.559 --> 00:03:10.777
A teacher?

00:03:12.257 --> 00:03:13.345
Turns out...

00:03:14.389 --> 00:03:15.916
I'm all of them.

00:03:24.443 --> 00:03:27.664
I am the Dragon Warrior.

00:03:28.839 --> 00:03:31.047
Get it?
See the giant dragon?

00:03:31.319 --> 00:03:32.756
[LAUGHING]

00:03:32.799 --> 00:03:35.096
Get ready to
feel the thunder.

00:03:35.323 --> 00:03:36.760
This is awesome!

00:03:37.456 --> 00:03:39.023
[LAUGHING]

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.765
[BARKING]

00:03:43.157 --> 00:03:44.768
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:47.553 --> 00:03:48.983
Hmm.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:54.516
[GRUNTS]

00:03:55.126 --> 00:03:56.486
Uh-oh.

00:03:57.084 --> 00:03:58.138
[GROWLS]

00:04:00.218 --> 00:04:01.698
[KAI YELLING]

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.135
Belly Gong.

00:04:04.178 --> 00:04:05.484
[GROANING]

00:04:05.527 --> 00:04:06.703
Butt Slap.

00:04:10.228 --> 00:04:11.316
Perhaps a bit of lunch.

00:04:11.359 --> 00:04:12.360
Because I'm starving.

00:04:12.404 --> 00:04:13.405
[INHALES]

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.431
Mmm.

00:04:28.115 --> 00:04:29.595
[SPITS]

00:04:29.639 --> 00:04:30.885
[LAUGHING]

00:04:32.206 --> 00:04:33.641
Let's do this!

00:04:33.644 --> 00:04:35.071
[GRUNTING]

00:04:37.995 --> 00:04:39.083
Heads up!

00:04:39.126 --> 00:04:40.127
[KAI SCREAMING]

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:49.884
[SNORTS]

00:04:54.054 --> 00:04:58.493
It took me 500 years
to take Oogway's chi.

00:04:58.537 --> 00:05:01.627
I will have yours
if it takes me 500 more.

00:05:01.671 --> 00:05:03.075
Chitty-chitty chat-chat.

00:05:03.119 --> 00:05:04.586
Chit-chat.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.979
[GRUNTING]

00:05:15.423 --> 00:05:17.077
You want my chi so bad...

00:05:17.687 --> 00:05:19.033
then take it.

00:05:22.082 --> 00:05:23.523
[GROANS]

00:05:25.738 --> 00:05:27.392
KAI: Yes.

00:05:27.435 --> 00:05:29.786
The power is mine.

00:05:32.614 --> 00:05:35.313
Wait. No. It's too much.

00:05:35.356 --> 00:05:37.141
That's too much! No!

00:05:38.098 --> 00:05:39.273
[SCREAMING]

00:05:41.362 --> 00:05:42.886
KAI: No!

00:05:45.192 --> 00:05:46.890
[ALL MURMURING]

00:05:51.721 --> 00:05:52.939
[ALL GASPING]

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:54.854
[GRUNTS]PANDAS: Oh!

00:05:54.898 --> 00:05:56.290
Where did he go?

00:06:01.905 --> 00:06:02.906
Oh![GASPING CONTINUES]

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:06.910
[GRUNTS] We're back!
Bestie!

00:06:06.953 --> 00:06:08.825
I'm still green!
It didn't work!

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:10.565
Oh, wait.
That's my normal green.

00:06:10.609 --> 00:06:12.263
[GASPS] Greeny Baby!

00:06:12.306 --> 00:06:14.352
Not a baby.
Not a baby!

00:06:14.395 --> 00:06:15.893
Antenna of Fear!

00:06:16.267 --> 00:06:17.485
What about Po?

00:06:17.529 --> 00:06:18.573
Have you seen Po?

00:06:18.617 --> 00:06:20.053
No. He's not here?

00:06:20.837 --> 00:06:23.491
Po? Po?

00:06:23.535 --> 00:06:25.189
Why isn't he back?

